[[Dante Vale]] and his team used a small speedboat to travel across the [[Seine River]] in search of the [[Cave of the Gargoyle]]. However they were soon surrounded by [[Gar-Ghoul]]'s powerful whirlpools, forcing them to jump to safety as Dante crashed the boat into the rocks, destroying it. {{source|Into the River of Secrets}}

In the [[Stavropolous River]], the Huntik team used another speedboat of the same model as they searched for the [[Argo]]. {{source|The Treasures of the Argonauts}} 

[[Wilder]] and his team used two speedboats to travel to [[Avalon]], following the Huntik team in their blue pontoon boat. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}

[[Grier]]'s [[Suits]] would their speedboats to transport supplies from the Greek coast to [[Sutos Island]]. One day, the Huntik accompanied them in the [[Huntik Foundation superyacht]] so that they could meet with [[Grier]] and ask him for help. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}
